    "megumi": "恵美"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After lunch, Muranishi sits across from Megumi Sahara for a quiet preliminary interview, asking about her upbringing, her family, and why she wants to step in front of the camera. Listen to Muranishi and Megumi in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お名前は？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "佐原恵美です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "恵美ちゃんは、なぜビデオに出演したいの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "イタリアに留学したくって、その資金集めのために。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "それと、本当の自分でいたくなったから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "本当の自分でいたいとは？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "自由で、奔放で、もしかすると汚らしい自分です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "ありのままを生きたいんです。どうしたらいいですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "君は、男性に何をしてほしいの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "まず安心させて。抱きしめてほしい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "おいで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "このほうが落ち着くの。こうしてほしかった。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お名前は？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is your full name?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "佐原恵美です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am Megumi Sahara.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "恵美ちゃんは、なぜビデオに出演したいの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Megumi, why do you want to appear in an adult video?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "イタリアに留学したくって、その資金集めのために。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want to study abroad in Italy, so it's to save up the funds.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "それと、本当の自分でいたくなったから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And also... because I started wanting to be my true self.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "本当の自分でいたいとは？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you mean by wanting to be your true self?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "自由で、奔放で、もしかすると汚らしい自分です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Free, uninhibited — and perhaps even an untamed side of myself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "ありのままを生きたいんです。どうしたらいいですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want to live just as I truly am. What should I do?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "君は、男性に何をしてほしいの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What would you like a man to do for you first?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "まず安心させて。抱きしめてほしい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'First, make me feel safe — hold me close.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "おいで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "このほうが落ち着くの。こうしてほしかった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Holding me tight like this calms me down — this is what I wanted all along.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お名前は？",
      "gap": 0.5
